        "detailed_description": "<h1>&lt;게임 콘텐츠 제작 및 스트리밍 가이드&gt;</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nientum - Op.ZERO&quot; allows full freedom for content creation and streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music included in the Early Access version does not use copyright-matching systems, so streaming and video monetization are permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any other inquiries related to the game, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:contact@queseragames.com\">contact@queseragames.com</a>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;—To fade away... was it hope for you and me, or despair?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Nientum – Op.Zero』</strong> is a 2D action-adventure music game that combines platformer, action, and adventure elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the stage through musical interactions and experience a unique journey to breathe life back into a theater that has settled in a gray stillness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Strange Play Created Without Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.poster.avif?t=1782974651\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.webm?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.mp4?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A theater once filled with songs and stories is now filled only with silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate place, Aleph and Liora, who have lost their memories, become the Director and the Actress to raise the curtain on a new play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a stage that is beautiful yet foreboding, warm yet sorrowful, they discover lost clues one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth will they face in the final scene of this play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare the Stage Through Action — The Power of 'Tuning'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.poster.avif?t=1782974651\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.webm?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.mp4?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gems scattered throughout the stages are fragments of broken notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Aleph’s ability to tune them, play their restored notes, and restore stage devices to complete the preparations for the performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As platforming, puzzles, and action naturally intertwine, the theater begins to regain its vitality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Performance Unfolds on the Stage You Tuned</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.poster.avif?t=1782974651\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.webm?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.mp4?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard of Oz, Cinderella, The Legend of King Arthur...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar tales are reinterpreted, and sometimes twisted, into musicals that unfold before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each of Liora’s successful performances, a fresh glow of life returns to the theater. And their journey continues to the next act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truth Brought to Light — Endings Shaped by Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.poster.avif?t=1782974651\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.webm?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.mp4?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmares and hope, wishes and despair, new encounters and farewells.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fragments of memory lost by Aleph and Liora are revealed one by one, following your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the direction of your choices, the end of the story takes a completely different turn, drastically altering their fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please, join them in their journey and help raise the curtain on this strange play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music and Voices that Bring the Stage to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is filled with music composed by renowned artists such as<br><strong>Kagetora., Halv, and seatrus</strong>, delivering a deeply immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters—including Aleph and Liora—are brought to life by talented voice actors such as<br><strong>Chika Anzai, Yuuki Takada, and Takehito Koyasu</strong>, vividly expressing the beauty and strangeness of the theater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Director's Room:</strong> A space where you can record and view the various collectibles gathered while completing the play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play Mode:</strong> A dedicated mode where you can enjoy tracks built with the rhythm-action expertise of Quesera Games, separate from the main story.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;—To fade away... was it hope for you and me, or despair?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Nientum – Op.Zero』</strong> is a 2D action-adventure music game that combines platformer, action, and adventure elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the stage through musical interactions and experience a unique journey to breathe life back into a theater that has settled in a gray stillness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Strange Play Created Without Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.poster.avif?t=1782974651\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.webm?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.mp4?t=1782974651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A theater once filled with songs and stories is now filled only with silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate place, Aleph and Liora, who have lost their memories, become the Director and the Actress to raise the curtain on a new play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a stage that is beautiful yet foreboding, warm yet sorrowful, they discover lost clues one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth will they face in the final scene of this play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare the Stage Through Action — The Power of 'Tuning'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://